# E9. The demo flow: walker simulate --arms --lift --script test/sim/lift/01-demo-flow.walk
# Home the lift, raise it to the tray, run the tray skill, "Let go?", fold the arm, lower the lift. SIMULATED lift
# board and arms under the real motion coordinator; the skill is the simulator's made-up sample
# (src/sim/sampleSkill.ts, "taught" at the made-up tray height of 300 mm), never a taught one. Every motion starts
# with a Confirm press `c`; the lift moves only while `lift-hold-on` plays the screen's hold control.
# Real time: about 60 s.

expect lift state unhomed
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key torque-on-right
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque right on

# 1. Home the lift, held on the screen.
key lift-hold-on
key lift-home
expect motion target lift.home operator_cli: Home the lift
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command lift.home started operator_cli
expect 40000 motion lift ended lift.home completed

# 2. Raise it to the tray.
key lift-up
expect motion target lift.move operator_cli: Raise the lift to 300 mm
wait 2100
key c
expect 30000 motion lift ended lift.move completed
expect 1000 lift state idle homed at 300 mm
key lift-hold-off

# 3. The arm to where the tray skill starts, then the skill: it grasps and ends holding.
key pose-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 8000 motion command arm.go_to_pose completed operator_cli
key object-left
key skill-run-sample
expect motion target skill.run operator_cli: SIMULATED sample: hold it out
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command skill.run started operator_cli
expect 3000 motion skill grasp left
expect 8000 motion command skill.run completed operator_cli

# 4. "Let go?": she takes it, then Confirm opens the hand.
expect motion target gripper.release walker_local: Let go?
key object-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 3000 motion command gripper.release completed walker_local

# 5. Fold the arm away, then lower the lift.
key pose-stowed-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 10000 motion command arm.go_to_pose completed operator_cli
key lift-hold-on
key lift-down
expect motion target lift.move operator_cli: Lower the lift to 50 mm
wait 2100
key c
expect 30000 motion lift ended lift.move completed
expect 1000 lift state idle homed at 50 mm
key lift-hold-off
absent 1000 motion fault
key q
